[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0010","text":"（啊──可可粉）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0020","text":"（这个，是新的）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0030","text":"（制作人虽然说了\n　随便喝就好……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0040","text":"（但、但开一罐新的可以吗……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0060","text":"——小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0070","text":"呀……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0080","text":"制、制作人！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0090","text":"哇、抱歉\n没想到你会吓成这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0100","text":"不、不是，我才该说对不起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0110","text":"……要喝可可吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0120","text":"诶……！对、对不起……\n新的是不可以的吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0130","text":"不，只要不是谁的私人物品\n你想喝就喝啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0140","text":"虽然不是说可以随便乱来\n但也不用太拘谨"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0150","text":"是、是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0160","text":"…………\n我也喝杯可可吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0170","text":"小糸也喝的对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03220000_03_0180","text":"啊，那个……好的！"}]
